From: Turner Linux Port <turner@localhost>
Subject: [RFC PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: mediatek: add MT6991 MFG EB clock ID

The GPUEB mailbox needs the embedded controller clock.

--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6991-clock.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6991-clock.h
@@ -45,6 +45,7 @@
 #define MT6991_CLK_TOP_MAINPLL_D9            34
 #define MT6991_CLK_TOP_I2C_WEST              35
 #define MT6991_CLK_TOP_I2C_EAST              36
+#define MT6991_CLK_TOP_MFG_EB                37
 
 #define MT6991_CLK_VLP_USB_TOP                0
 #define MT6991_CLK_VLP_USB_XHCI               1
